                "synopses": {
                    "short": "OJ is live through the night live from the Salford Riviera.",
                    "medium": "OJ is live through the night live from the Salford Riviera, with a Punderland XI, Midnight Mastermind, Wish You Were There and Shiftfaced.",
                    "long": "OJ makes being awake fun, live from the Salford Riviera.\n\nMidnight Mastermind is the quiz where you ask the questions and test OJ on your own specialist subject. He never knows the subject beforehand and has just one song to revise before facing the questions.\n\nWish You Were There is your chance to soundtrack a story or situation that OJ will tell you all about. He wants your suggestions for the perfect song to capture that moment.\n\nShiftfaced is for everyone on the nightshift, working hard to keep the country going. Tell OJ what you\u2019re up to, who you\u2019re with and where you are. And he\u2019s always keen to know what snacks are powering you through!\n\nTo get involved with the show, e-mail OJ@bbc.co.uk\n\nTo listen on most smart speakers, just say \"Ask BBC Sounds to play OJ Borg.\""
